   "text": "Rynek Główny and the streets leading to it were closed after Saturday's shooting, and the Mariacka Basilica closed until further notice. The Rynek horse-cab stand and its substitute stands stay shut until further notice. Expect police cordons and diversions in the Old Town and Stradom, and check ZTP before travelling.",
   "link": "https://lovekrakow.pl/strzelanina-w-centrum-krakowa-nie-zyje-szesc-osob"
  },
  {
   "kind": "Event",
   "text": "City mourning runs 8-11 Nov. All events run by City Hall, city units and municipal companies are cancelled, including city Independence Day events. The previously announced programme (Bieg Niepodległości at 11:11, the patriotic tram, the 17:00 singing lesson on the Rynek) may be cancelled or changed, so confirm with organisers.",
   "link": "https://pulskrakowa.pl/prezydent-krakowa-oglosil-zalobe-miejskie-imprezy-odwolane-do-11-listopada/"
  },
  {
