   "text": "Stary Teatr, Cricoteka, Kino Kijów and the Szymanowski Philharmonic cancelled shows after the attack. Check before going to any cultural event this week.",
   "link": "https://www.se.pl/krakow/dramat-w-krakowie-strzaly-na-rynku-glownym-sa-doniesienia-o-rannych-aa-j9KR-i4b6-47km.html"
  },
  {
   "kind": "Transit",
   "text": "KMK trams and buses carry black mourning bands until 11 Nov. No timetable changes for mourning have been announced. New line 714 (Bronowice Małe - Dworzec Główny Zachód) starts Monday 9 Nov.",
